WikiMaps — data attribution & licensing
========================================

Active historical borders (data/europe/)
----------------------------------------
Source: OpenHistoricalMap — https://www.openhistoricalmap.org
License: CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication). No restriction; attribution is courtesy.
Seeded via the OHM Overpass API (admin_level=2 boundaries) and transformed into the
year-precise WikiMaps schema (multilingual names, validity dates, Wikidata QIDs).

Basemap
-------
Natural Earth (data in public/basemap/) — https://www.naturalearthdata.com — public domain.

Legacy world snapshots (data/borders/)
--------------------------------------
Derived from Historical Basemaps (André Ourednik & contributors):
  https://github.com/aourednik/historical-basemaps
These files remain in the repo as a possible deep-time fallback but are NOT used by the app.
Upstream license is GPL-3.0 with no explicit data license (ambiguous) — see issue #12. If
these files are ever shipped to users, that ambiguity must be resolved first.

